{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113379438855704576"]}, "author_id": "855548998907699200", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:20:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113380052931170481"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 97, "id": "1452175050765864960", "start": 87, "username": "WisprFlow"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hPLoTBbu6p", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/tankots/status/2113380052931170481/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113379438855704576", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/hPLoTBbu6p"}]}, "id": "2113380052931170481", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 172, "impression_count": 92382, "like_count": 1824, "quote_count": 16, "reply_count": 168, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "hey twitter\n\nfor everyone new here, a quick reintro:\n\ni'm tanay, co-founder and ceo of @WisprFlow \n\n• grew up in delhi\n• at 11, built one of the first voice assistants with a friend. 2.5m users, then got shut down\n• built 60-70 more products before college\n• at 15, became cto https://t.co/hPLoTBbu6p", "url": "https://x.com/tankots/status/2113380052931170481"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113258449677041664"]}, "author_id": "1069599820912910337", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:27:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113412078018916848"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0uybmTpszK", "end": 1201, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MindNexusLive/status/2113260285867835592/video/1", "media_key": "13_2113258449677041664", "start": 1178, "url": "https://t.co/0uybmTpszK"}]}, "id": "2113412078018916848", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 4487, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "睡觉时梦境能被远程操控，五角大楼前顾问警告大脑失守。\n\n说话的人叫 Matthew Brown，之前是五角大楼的政策顾问。\n他在 Jesse Michels 的访谈节目里，给出了一个断言：\n“我们的大脑，不再享有主权。”\n\n按照他的说法，现在的技术已经能做到远程接入人类思维。\n不需要动手术，不需要在头皮上贴电极片。", "url": "https://x.com/mubeitech/status/2113412078018916848"}, {"author_id": "1914410997399609344", "created_at": "2026-10-22T